<task id="118" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Integration seam test: dispatch spine (message -&gt; handler -&gt; Cosmos transition -&gt; DAG advance)</title>
    <phase>C'' Wave G-1 -- Foundation</phase>
    <gate>cleared</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>TEST-MODIFYING (unconditional FULL)</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Touches tests/integration/seam/** and is tagged testing/integration-test -- unconditional FULL per root CLAUDE.md §8 override table.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Well-specified seam test following DS-2 §6.2's exact design -- Sonnet @ high, not architecturally novel (the architecture is already locked, this proves it).</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>102, 104, 106, 108</deps>
    <tags>l2-controlplane, dispatcher, testing, integration-test</tags>
    <estimated-effort>8-12 hours</estimated-effort>
